@format 1
@id edit.restore-plan
@title Restore edit plan
@area Edit
@entry input
@summary Resolve source-sidecar and tab-persistent Crop, rotation, tone, and skip state when the active edit source changes.
@flow TB
@related edit.save-plan, queue.create-saved-edit-work

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab
@alias edit = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LEdit

[input] Active edit source changes <input>
- Begin Crop and plan restoration for the active viewer source @ tab.PEditCropRestore(...)
> resolve

[resolve] Resolve plan sources <process>
- Read the source sidecar plan @ edit.LEditPlanRead(...)
- Merge it with tab-persistent Crop, tone, and skip settings @ edit.LEditPlanResolve(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply edit state <process>
- Apply rotation, Crop, tone, and skip state to viewer and inspector @ tab.PEditCropRestore(...)
- Refresh preview transformations and processing indicators @ tab.PEditViewerApply(...)
> result

[result] Edit plan restored <output>
= The active viewer and inspector represent the resolved plan for the source.
